  "steps": [
    "Boil the soya chunks and squeeze out all the excess water.",
    "Heat Shalimar Mustard Oil in a pan. Add soya chunks, red chilli powder, turmeric powder and salt. Sauté for a few minutes and set aside.",
    "Blend tomatoes, soaked mustard seeds, garlic, green chillies and ginger into a smooth paste.",
    "Heat Shalimar Mustard Oil in a pan. Add coriander powder, red chilli powder, cumin powder and turmeric powder.",
    "Add the prepared gravy and salt. Cook for a few minutes.",
    "Add the sautéed soya chunks, a pinch of sugar and a little water if required.",
    "Cover and cook for a few more minutes until the gravy coats the soya beautifully.",
    "Garnish with fresh coriander and serve hot."
